& [ImplementationCoverage_001_010] is audited
  + CDRA-001 verified -> exact CTPR and runtime profiles, unsupported-version negatives, and normalized restoration
  + CDRA-002 verified -> root and every candidate form validate before an accepted successor
  + CDRA-003 verified -> ordered maps and sets, canonical JSON, priority tie-break, permutation refusal, and byte-stable replay
  + CDRA-004 verified -> supplied immutable root, pure evaluator, no global state, and 55-operation replay
  + CDRA-005 verified -> accepted successor plus receipt and refusal-without-successor tests preserve the prior value
  + CDRA-006 verified -> unsupported profile, invalid form, stale, bound, duplicate, and other typed faults
  + CDRA-007 verified -> in-memory generation, event, content, snapshot, byte, branch-head, and index state
  + CDRA-008 verified -> exact branch head and predecessor checks, stale refusal, missing predecessor refusal, and frontier reconstruction
  + CDRA-009 verified -> supplied logical counter and deterministic trace order only
  + CDRA-010 verified -> supplied byte length and SHA256 verification with no filesystem read

& [ImplementationCoverage_011_020] is audited
  + CDRA-011 verified -> exact event frontier, snapshot digest, predecessor, and atomic-external-world-claim refusal
  + CDRA-012 verified -> deterministic index rebuild with explicit source generation and root reconstruction checks
  + CDRA-013 partial -> candidate branch and multi-predecessor merge preserve ancestry; rejection, supersession, and compaction are form states without dedicated runtime transitions
  + CDRA-014 verified -> positive admitted logical advance, zero refusal, root-bound receipt, and replay
  + CDRA-015 verified -> immutable item, wake, recurrence, lifecycle, authority, and local-only provider state
  + CDRA-016 verified -> explicit UTC and Gregorian policy, inclusion, exception, occurrence, and runtime horizon bounds
  + CDRA-017 verified -> Due, Missed, Cancelled, Completed, and Superseded each produce a legal supplied-time candidate transition and no admitted event
  + CDRA-018 verified -> exact task, plan, repository, capsule, policy, authority, and requirement revalidation with mismatch refusal
  + CDRA-019 verified -> schedule proposal, Calendar revision, event candidate, wake candidate, provider state, and execution observation remain distinct forms and outputs
  + CDRA-020 verified -> no temporal input changes priority, truth, consent, authority, or effects; candidate-only outputs and source audit preserve the boundary

& [ImplementationCoverage_021_030] is audited
  + CDRA-021 verified -> exact DAG validation, stable cycle witness, unresolved-reference refusal, and unchanged prior root
  + CDRA-022 verified -> declared numeric priority then stable identity; dependency order and normalized replay are deterministic
  + CDRA-023 verified -> task identity, exact plan predecessor, current repository, Calendar view, proof gates, recognized resources, policy, and operation root are checked
  + CDRA-024 verified_at_bounded_fixture_grade -> supplied alternatives, assumptions, uncertainty, review gates, task stop conditions, and proof routes remain unchanged in the admitted proposal record
  + CDRA-025 partial -> Capture, Aggregate, and Omit are deterministic and evidenced; the signed form ABI does not distinguish transient from rejected disposition
  + CDRA-026 verified -> propose_plan accepts only PlanState Proposed and emits no commitment, Calendar mutation, repository admission, or work execution
  + CDRA-027 verified -> exhaustive 144-pair capsule lifecycle relation plus operation-level evidence and predecessor gates
  + CDRA-028 verified -> opening pins exact task, plan, repository, capsule, intent targets, effects, proof, and unrelated exclusions
  + CDRA-029 verified -> execution lane returns only the exact inert simulated outcome named by the capsule
  + CDRA-030 verified -> exact retrospective cursor and capsule generation with evidence, objection, uncertainty, invalidation, residual, and disposition records

& [ImplementationCoverage_031_040] is audited
