  + CDRA-032 verified -> derived complete return set, settled lanes, acknowledgment, subject, repository, plan, policy, authority, and disposition gates
  + CDRA-033 verified -> exact barrier return and dependency sets; Block cannot release and Qualify releases only the named set
  + CDRA-034 verified -> exhaustive 144-pair lane lifecycle relation, count lag, logical timeout, cancellation, residual, and exact crash reentry
  + CDRA-035 verified -> fixed bounded digest-verified SOP, SemanticIR, BuildIR, target, impact, correspondence, proof, and diff records
  + CDRA-036 verified -> impact-derived forward identity, dependency, diagnostic, invalidation, target, proof, and unknown prediction
